OL,3,GNEWSAFour dogs die in 'suspicious'
OL,4,Avehicles blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blaze, which damaged four vehicles
OL,7,Fand killed four dogs, is being treated
OL,8,Fas suspicious, a fire service has said.
OL,10,FKent Fire and Rescue Service said crews
OL,11,Fwere called to reports of three vans
OL,12,Fand a car on fire in Avery Way,
OL,13,FAllhallows, at 00:40 GMT.
OL,15,FIt said three people were treated by
OL,16,Fthe ambulance service for smoke
OL,17,Finhalation and minor burns.
OL,19,FFour fire engines and a bulk water
OL,20,Fcarrier attended and crews wearing
OL,21,Fbreathing apparatus used hose-reel jets
OL,22,Fto extinguish the fire.
